    standard 24x24 viewBox by tools/bake-dragon.py. Side profile facing right:
    long snout angled up, sweeping horn, large arched bat-wing with scalloped
    membrane, four legs, long curling tail. Single connected silhouette so
    NonZero (default) fill is correct.
